WEBVTT

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:35.320
Haruka, somebody's here.

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:39.730
What is it, Atori? Is somebody here?

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.600
I don't see anyone.

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:48.130
They were here.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:49.460
Atori?

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:52.440
But they didn't hang around.

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:48.000
Well, Kosagi? Are you
feeling more stable?

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:50.160
I am always calm.

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:55.520
Securing the Dragon Torque
is the one, single mission...

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.800
given to us dragon soldiers.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:01.240
It's impossible for you
to capture it by yourself.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:05.510
If I hadn't been forcefully
re-transported, I would have secured her!

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:08.640
The Dragon Torque has begun
to have a will of its own.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:10.710
It must be approached with caution.

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:17.490
It doesn't matter if I disappear
in the process! As long as I secure it...

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:18.590
Enough!

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:24.730
Why don't you understand?

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:27.760
La'cryma needs the Dragon Torque!

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:31.470
That's not what I meant.
Why can't you understand?

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.610
Wh-What are you doing, Kuina?!

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:37.900
It's no concern of mine what
happens to the world of La'cryma.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.350
I need you.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:43.180
Wh-What?!

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:45.020
I don't want to lose you.

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:45.910
Kuina...

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:49.020
I want to live my life with you, Kosagi.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:06.430
I'm coming in, Yuu.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.540
Looks like another nice day.

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.280
So, you were studying.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:16.680
Yeah.

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:18.020
Making progress?

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:19.280
Sort of.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:27.020
Hey, Yuu? Would you help me
clean out the storage room?

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.290
The storage room?

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:32.300
I can't very well lift
heavy things all by myself, can I?

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:34.100
Oh, all right.

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:38.000
Uh, Yuu?

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:42.040
This will be your last summer break
before you become a teenager, right?

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:45.510
Well, yeah. I'll be 13 next year.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:48.210
That's why I think you
should use this summer break...

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:50.520
to do everything you want to do.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.520
There's nothing I really want to do.

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:57.020
You need to enjoy your childhood.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.690
I'll goof off as much as
I want after the exams.

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:01.590
Yuu...

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.760
Mom, what's this?

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:08.500
What?

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.730
Oh, it's the video camera.

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:12.100
This?

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:15.430
Your father went out and
bought it when you were born.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:17.170
Wow, it's big.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.280
It was pretty expensive.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.400
It's not quite right.

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:55.310
This sure is boring.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:57.370
Wedding?!

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.990
Your mother and father?

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:02.120
Why are they having a wedding now?

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:04.390
Apparently when they got married...

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:07.360
mom decided not to have a wedding
because it was too expensive.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:09.800
But it's always bothered dad.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:13.500
And so they're having
a wedding. How romantic!

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:16.350
Yeah, my parents still
get along really well.

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:20.030
That's true. They're always
fooling around with each other.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:24.410
I'm sure your mother would
look great in a wedding dress.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.570
She'll be gorgeous! Tres bien!

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:30.050
Yeah! She's always so kind and pretty.

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:31.610
At least, she is NOW.

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:32.210
Huh?

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:34.690
The real reason they
didn't have a wedding...

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:36.190
The real reason?

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:37.000
...is this.

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:38.750
What is it?

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.500
Eee, that girl is so cool!

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:44.570
Ai... is this your mom?

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:46.290
Eeek! No way!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.860
It was taken when
she was in high school.

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:52.170
Dad doesn't know about it.

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:53.840
Lemme see it again.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:56.670
Still, your mom sure is cool, Ai.

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:59.910
Hey, whatcha lookin' at? Lemme see.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:03.190
- No way! You're not allowed!
- Impossible!

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:05.880
Oh, Yuu!

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:08.320
Where'd you get that, Goto?

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:10.090
I found it at home.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:12.050
Wow, it looks professional.

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:13.220
I think it is.

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:15.420
- Can you work that thing, Yuu?
- Sorta.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:19.370
That's it! Hey, Goto? Would you
be the cameraman at the wedding?

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.860
Whose wedding?

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:23.630
Ai's mom and dad.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:26.130
We were looking for someone to film it!

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:27.670
Really?

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:29.300
Then you'll do it?

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:30.640
Uh, I guess so...

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:34.080
Cameraman, huh? Hey, that's cool.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:36.280
Good luck with that, Yuu.

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:44.050
What's wrong?

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:46.220
It disappeared.

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:49.960
Are they out there, Uchida-chan?

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:51.900
Yes. 1, 2...

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:55.000
...3, 4, 5. They're all there.

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:57.910
So, the party has arrived.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:00.730
I didn't think the lab boats
would get here so quickly.

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:03.710
Shinohara must've sent
for them well in advance, huh?

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:08.240
It was his plan to quash the Ab-Com
investigation results from the get-go.

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:12.780
On top of that, he used it
as a means to move the project forward.

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:15.460
I must make it stop at any cost.

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:20.060
He can't use this place-site of continuous
abnormal quantum potential fluctuation...

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:22.420
to activate the Magic Circle!

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:25.430
Well, they do say that arrogance...

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.700
is the path to self-destruction.

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:30.740
Kooriyama-san?

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:36.170
Although... we adults are
living proof of that arrogance.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:47.460
But we must never destroy...
...the future of our children.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:51.480
Haruka's power may be accelerating.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:54.490
You think she's making
dimensions contact with others?

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:57.160
That's highly probable.

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.370
Hey, Karasu?

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:04.270
Was the strange place
that I saw, Shangri-la?

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:09.520
It was from about that time I started
being able to see those people.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:11.300
What people?

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:14.030
Yeah, although they're
not really people...

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:18.490
Shangri-la?

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:20.950
Do you think so?

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:26.040
I think they want to meet me.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:31.790
He also said that I would end up coming
to that placed called Shangri-la.

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:33.300
The man in the mask?

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.700
Yeah.

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:41.100
The appearance rates at the zero point
are increasing tremendously.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.110
It might be linked to that.

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:48.080
The erosion of Shangri-la might
already have started in this dimension.

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:56.190
Commence revision of coordinates XXX.

00:09:56.430 --> 00:10:01.230
Countdown: 5, 4, 3, 2...

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:02.790
What are you looking at?

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.130
...zero.

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:07.240
I mean, what can you see, Kosagi?

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.960
I can see nothing.

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:12.870
We don't have the ability
to observe those coordinates.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:14.530
True.

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:17.340
Some things are best left unseen.

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:21.080
W2 is gone. Pulldown, pulldown.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:24.750
It's happening again. Observers are
falling apart one after the other.

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:27.850
The dimensional waver is accelerating.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:33.320
The limes may be at their limit.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.760
We must secure the
Dragon Torque immediately.

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:39.730
Nothing more can be done for La'cryma.

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:43.960
I've acquired something unusual.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.740
Lipstick?

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:56.580
I will go to find a dimension
where we can live together.

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:13.400
You two wait here.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:14.600
Sir!

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:40.050
Your expulsion from the elite
dwelling quarters to this place...

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:42.830
is your punishment for letting
the Dragon Torque and Karasu escape.

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.130
It is by the mercy of the leadership
department that you weren't wiped out.

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:47.140
Be grateful for that, Amamiku.

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:48.930
I'm not regretting at all.

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:55.230
When you realize there is a mistake,
is it wrong to correct it?

00:11:56.510 --> 00:12:00.070
We are fighting to
keep La'cryma in existence!

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:04.450
You people committed the folly
of being so blinded by the past...

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.680
you lost the possibility of a future!

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:08.990
That's not true, Kosagi.

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:10.550
What?!

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:15.090
Regret the past so we shall never repeat
the same mistake.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:19.250
We were given that opportunity
by the Dragon Torque.

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:22.560
You people are confused.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:25.770
That is only a dimension
we have simulated!

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:29.740
The Dragon Torque itself is no more than
a body of energy created by a quantum spin.

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:31.470
Believing that is a human being...

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:34.140
is merely the result of
existential interference!

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:38.520
Maybe so, but my own existence...

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:40.730
has recognized that girl as Haruka.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:45.690
And she in return has recognized me.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:47.990
...by my real name.

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:52.000
But Karasu and Fukuro
fought because of her...

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:54.730
...and Fukuro died.

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:04.940
Kuina.

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.810
You're...

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:14.520
I have a favor to ask.
I want to go to defeat Karasu.

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:16.020
Kosagi!

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:17.650
I want to settle it.

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:24.690
I'm so tired. This sucks.

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:27.500
They're so annoying.
Are they sickening, or what?

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:33.830
Huh?

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:36.870
Hey, you're hitting
someone with your leg.

00:13:37.110 --> 00:13:39.130
What the? Who is this girl?

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:41.810
Apologize to the nice old lady.

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:43.410
It's all right, young lady.

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:44.940
It's not all right.

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:47.020
Which middle school
did you crawl out of?

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:48.550
I'm in elementary school.

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:54.890
What now? She's in elementary school.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:57.060
This is so bad.
We're being way made fun of.

00:13:57.470 --> 00:13:59.990
If you don't want to be made fun of,
then why don't you learn some manners?

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:05.770
Why don't you come with us
for a walk, little girl?

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:15.500
Hey, is that Hasebe?

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:19.410
What're you doing? Let go!

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.050
Don't mess with me, little punk!?

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:24.080
Maybe, we need to teach her a lesson.

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:27.590
Hey, Hasebe!

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:30.930
What're you doing here?

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:33.560
Who are these girls?
Friends of yours?

00:14:35.070 --> 00:14:37.730
No way! These girls
are impossibly gorgeous!

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:41.680
I mean it! Hi! I'm her classmate.

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:44.410
Which high school do you girls attend?

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:47.390
You're so hot. Talk about eye candy!

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:53.890
Who is this weird kid?
Did you hear that thing about eye candy?

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.720
He's like Fujiwara in Class B!

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:57.120
Maybe it's his little brother!

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:05.400
I can't go on. I laughed myself tired.

00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:06.910
Let's go.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.360
Yeah, let's get outta here.

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:10.600
- That was so lame.
- Bye...

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:16.500
What are you doing?
Those guys are known for being nasty.

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:18.000
But I...

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:20.950
You probably called them out
for being rude or something.

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:23.250
Geez, you gotta learn
to pick your opponents!

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:26.720
But then I guess you'd have
no way of knowing about them...

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:29.990
since I only heard about 'em
from my idiot brother.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:31.240
Sorry.

00:15:32.390 --> 00:15:33.760
I'm sorry.

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:35.480
Don't cry!

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:38.670
But I... I was so scared of them.

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:43.250
Then cry sooner!
Someone would come help you.

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:46.670
I don't want jerks like them
to threaten me into crying!

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:50.040
What's that supposed to mean?
That doesn't make sense.

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:52.210
Here, wipe with this.

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:55.340
It's dirty.

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:57.080
Hey!

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:59.550
Okay, so you are using it.
You're impossible...

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:02.100
Thanks.

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.820
No problemo.

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:05.190
Fujiwara...

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.470
Thanks for bailing me out.

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:12.150
Anytime!

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:20.610
I pray that Fukuro's REIZU may
come to rest in a beautiful place.

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:28.950
The abnormal range of the
place-site is spreading again.

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:31.920
The dimensional interference
is probably getting worse.

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:34.890
And yet it looks so peaceful.

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:38.260
I'm jealous of your past, Karasu.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:40.190
This place is merely an approximation.

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:42.960
My time has not appeared precisely.

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:46.690
That may be true, but
it's infinitely similar, right?

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:52.630
The country where
I was raised was so horrible.

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:59.910
But I've already forgotten
about those times.

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.940
Atori is the same.

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:08.940
What is this?!

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:13.390
An undulation. This
dimension is shaking, Karasu!

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:15.450
This sensation...

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.190
It's La'cryma!

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:20.400
Tobi, I'm heading in first!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:25.870
Now, I want you to behave yourself
like the lady you are.

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:28.430
Yeah, I know... by the way...

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:30.850
...is this gonna be okay?

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.900
It doesn't look weird
from the back, does it?

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.180
It's perfect. You look charming.

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:38.390
Really?!

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:41.850
Really. You're so sweet,
I could eat you up!

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:43.550
You think so?

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:45.860
You're a cutie, Haruka!
That's my daughter for ya!

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:47.920
Oh, please. You're embarrassing me.

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:50.100
See you later!

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.830
Be careful now!

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:13.150
Have its powers increased?!

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:16.820
It merely looks like a child.

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:20.950
It's merely a convergence
of high density energy.

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:23.690
If I can just contain
the volatile reaction...

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:26.200
Are you from the future too?

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:30.060
Please don't fight with Karasu.

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:33.370
I don't want Karasu to fight
with anybody anymore.

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:35.170
You...

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:40.010
Karasu!

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:47.150
Time stopped.

00:18:52.890 --> 00:18:53.860
Karasu...

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:33.790
You traitor! I will never forgive you!

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:38.910
I swear I'll take you down with me!

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:43.410
Go home, Kosagi. It's
pointless to fight with you.

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:48.250
Karasu!

00:20:00.560 --> 00:20:02.620
Are you the one who killed Fukuro?

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:05.320
No.

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:07.760
Even if it wasn't...

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:09.270
I will obliterate you.

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:11.240
I can not disappear yet.

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:13.740
Then fight me, Karasu!

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:25.620
Why? Why, Karasu?!

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:28.080
Why won't you face me?!

00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:31.090
You cannot fight in your current state.

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.140
You damned traitor.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:53.540
You're a coward who betrayed his
allies for an illusion of the past!

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:56.320
I will never forgive you!

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:58.110
Stop this, Kosagi.

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:00.690
Why, you...

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:05.280
Killing me or Karasu
won't save La'cryma.

00:21:05.890 --> 00:21:09.780
The erosion of Shangri-la can be
contained if we use the Dragon Torque!

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:12.600
You're wrong.

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:16.590
The energy of the Dragon Torque
does not exist for that purpose.

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:21.030
I believe it has appeared to
restore every warped dimension.

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:25.310
I don't think it's a coincidence
that we found the Dragon Torque.

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:29.750
It is a necessity... for the dimension.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:32.000
You're full of it!

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:35.020
Besides, you can't kill Karasu.

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:39.250
Be honest with yourself.

00:21:44.630 --> 00:21:45.760
It changed back?

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:50.260
Karasu! Return to La'cryma!

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:51.830
Kosagi...

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:56.270
Surely you're aware that by
staying unconnected to the pipeline...

00:21:56.310 --> 00:21:58.440
you will eventually vanish!

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:00.340
I must protect Haruka.

00:22:01.350 --> 00:22:02.780
Karasu...

00:22:03.890 --> 00:22:05.820
You care that deeply for her?

00:22:11.860 --> 00:22:13.190
Kosagi?

00:22:21.010 --> 00:22:22.630
Pipeline cut-off reading.

00:22:23.740 --> 00:22:25.330
That can't be.

00:22:38.050 --> 00:22:39.650
Kosagi...

00:22:44.160 --> 00:22:47.530
When you go, I want to be there to see it.

00:22:53.340 --> 00:22:54.730
Baron.

00:22:55.500 --> 00:22:56.930
Haruka?

00:22:58.010 --> 00:22:59.670
What's wrong?

00:23:00.580 --> 00:23:03.760
I'm waiting for Karasu.

00:24:42.240 --> 00:24:44.300
I'm dreaming again.

00:24:45.210 --> 00:24:47.110
That summer day's dream.

00:24:48.450 --> 00:24:51.420
Hey, what do you think that is?

00:24:59.930 --> 00:25:03.420
You... collapse... and die.

00:25:03.730 --> 00:25:06.900
Next episode, Nightmare.

00:25:06.940 --> 00:25:10.000
Is the world you live in, a reality?
